    <unit id="=&gt;q15" name="=&gt;q15">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">30</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Damn it, aintcha one persistent $(#jackass/scag)! Do ya know what kind of stuff's inside that vault behind me? Do ya? Well it's half-flooded now, ya jerk, and I'm really, *really* pissed off about it - and yer pissin' me off even further with yer dumb-ass questions.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q16" name="=&gt;q16">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">32</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>That good enough for ya!? Will ya stop asking me questions now!?

If ya say no - *if* ya say no... I'll kill ya. 

I swear.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
